OL,3,GNEWSATriple killers' victims died of
OL,4,Ahead injuries
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree elderly men killed by a man later
OL,7,Ffound not guilty of their murders due
OL,8,Fto insanity suffered head injuries, an
OL,9,Finquest has been told.
OL,11,FTwins Dick and Roger Carter, 84, and
OL,12,FAnthony Payne, 80, died after being
OL,13,Fattacked by Alexander Lewis-Ranwell on
OL,14,F10 February 2019 in Exeter.
OL,16,FThe then 28-year-old Lewis-Ranwell, who
OL,17,Fhad twice been arrested and released on
OL,18,Fbail in the two days prior to the
OL,19,Fkillings, was later found to be
OL,20,F"acutely psychotic", jurors in the
OL,21,Finquest at Exeter County Hall were
OL,22,Ftold.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
